n in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Culture, Customs and Traditions"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "Countries and regions around the world have their own beliefs, ways of life and art. These are all nouns you can use to  talk about <span class=\"strong\">culture</span>. <br /><br /><span class=\"strong\">Traditions</span>  are ways of thinking, behaving, or doing something that has been used by the people in a group, family, or society, for a long time. Like a cultural traditions, like eating turkey at Thanksgiving or an ancient/old tradition, like not eating fish on Friday.<br /><br /><span class=\"strong\">Customs</span>  are actions or ways of acting among the people in a particular group or place. There can be tribal, local, family or ancient customs. There are social customs, like taking off your hat inside and English/Italian customs, like having afternoon tea."}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn4le04ob04re1img01.png"}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "tradition   "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a way of thinking, or doing something  used by the people in a particular group for a long time"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example:  Isn't having apple pie an American tradition?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le04ob04aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use when you talk about the past."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "origins   "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the place or type of family that a person or food comes from "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Do you know the origin of spaghetti?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le04ob04aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "explorer  "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a person who travels in order to learn more about the world or to find something"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: He was a famous Italian explorer of the 13th century."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le04ob04aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "noisy    "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "making a lot of loud or unpleasant sounds"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: It's so noisy in here. I am getting a headache."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le04ob04aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to join   "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to put or bring things or people together "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example:  Please join me for a walk."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le04ob04aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "choice  "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "picking or deciding between two or more options "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example:  Spaghetti was a great choice."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le04ob04aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "spaghetti  "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "pasta in the shape of long, thin strings  "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: This spaghetti is delicious!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le04ob04aud05"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Choose three countries."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Research their traditional meals. Some countries have more than one traditional meal."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Complete the table with the information."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Use the information in the table to write a sentence for each country."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Share your answers with a partner."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Country\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Traditional Meal\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"&nbsp;\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"&nbsp;\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"&nbsp;\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I identify traditional meals of different countries."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write sentences on traditional meals."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I discuss traditional meals with a partner."}]}], "type": "sena"}